# astrion-skill v1
goal: Move all screenshots older than 7 days to ~/Screenshots/Archive
trigger:
  - phrase: "clean screenshots"
  - phrase: "archive screenshots"
  - phrase: "tidy screenshots"
do: |
  Find all .png and .jpg files in the user's default screenshot folder
  (per OS) whose mtime is older than 7 days. Confirm count with the
  user via rapid-confirm ("Move X screenshots to Archive?"). On
  confirm, create ~/Screenshots/Archive if missing and move the files
  there. Show summary toast with count and recoverable path.
constraints:
  level: L2
  budget_tokens: 300
  reversibility: BOUNDED
